{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17380","headline":"奉和韦谏议奉送水部家兄上後书情寄诸兄弟仍通简南宫亲旧幷呈两省阁老院长 · 权德舆","name":"奉和韦谏议奉送水部家兄上後书情寄诸兄弟仍通简南宫亲旧幷呈两省阁老院长","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"驷牡龙旗庆至今，一门儒服耀华簪。\n人望皆同照乘宝，家风不重满籝金。\n护衣直夜南宫静，焚草清时左掖深。\n何幸末班陪两地，阳春欲和意难任。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17380.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17380","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}